#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use these tutorials to learn how to apply Qiskit to common quantum computing"
" use cases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Guna tutorial-tutorial ni untuk belajar cara guna Qiskit bagi kes-kes "
"penggunaan pengkomputeran kuantum yang biasa.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Start with the set of tutorials in the [Get started](#get-started) section "
"if it is your first time running code on a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mulakan dengan set tutorial dalam bahagian [Mula](#get-started) kalau ni "
"kali pertama kamu jalankan kod pada komputer kuantum.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The section on [workflows toward advantage](#explore-workflows-toward-"
"advantage) contains end-to-end examples of using a quantum computer to solve"
" real-world problems. These tutorials focus on algorithms that are promising"
" candidates for achieving computational advantage by a quantum computer over"
" a classical computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian [aliran kerja menuju kelebihan](#explore-workflows-toward-"
"advantage) mengandungi contoh hujung-ke-hujung cara menggunakan komputer "
"kuantum untuk selesaikan masalah dunia nyata. Tutorial-tutorial ni fokus "
"pada algoritma yang berpotensi besar untuk mencapai kelebihan pengkomputeran"
" komputer kuantum berbanding komputer klasik.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The section on [Qiskit capabilities](#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) contains"
" examples that use the latest and most advanced techniques in the Qiskit "
"ecosystem to improve part or the whole of a particular workflow.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bahagian [keupayaan Qiskit](#leverage-qiskit-capabilities) mengandungi "
"contoh yang menggunakan teknik terbaru dan paling canggih dalam ekosistem "
"Qiskit untuk memperbaiki sebahagian atau keseluruhan aliran kerja "
"tertentu.\n"

