"These tutorials are for beginners who are ready to explore running quantum "
"algorithms on a quantum computer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial-tutorial ni untuk pemula yang dah bersedia nak terokai cara "
"menjalankan algoritma kuantum pada komputer kuantum.\n"

