#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Tutorials in this section cover large-scale demonstrations of quantum "
"algorithms.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial dalam bahagian ni merangkumi demonstrasi berskala besar bagi "
"algoritma kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Verifiable sampling algorithms**\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"**Algoritma pensampelan boleh disahkan**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The algorithms in this category focus on quantum circuits whose output "
"distributions encode solutions to structured problems with verifiable "
"output. Verifiability means that you can check the consistency between "
"measured data, either through evaluating the chosen bitstring or by knowing "
"that false positives do not occur.\n"
msgstr ""
"Algoritma dalam kategori ni fokus pada Circuit kuantum yang taburan "
"outputnya mengekod penyelesaian kepada masalah berstruktur dengan output "
"yang boleh disahkan. Boleh disahkan bermaksud kamu boleh semak ketekalan "
"antara data yang diukur, sama ada dengan menilai bitstring yang dipilih atau"
" dengan mengetahui bahawa positif palsu tidak berlaku.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The tutorials highlight techniques where repeated sampling enables "
"estimation of problem-specific quantities (for example, cost function values"
" or spectral weights). These methods are particularly relevant for "
"optimization and simulation tasks with symmetries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial-tutorial ini menyerlahkan teknik di mana pensampelan berulang "
"membolehkan anggaran kuantiti khusus masalah (contohnya, nilai fungsi kos "
"atau pemberat spektral). Kaedah-kaedah ini amat relevan untuk tugasan "
"pengoptimuman dan simulasi dengan simetri.\n"

