#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"**Observable estimation**\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"**Anggaran boleh cerapan**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"These tutorials focus on estimating physically meaningful quantities, such "
"as energy or correlation values, by preparing quantum states and measuring "
"observables. Techniques include both variational and Trotterized circuit "
"approaches that balance circuit expressiveness with circuit-depth "
"efficiency. Emphasis is placed on workflows that reduce quantum resource "
"demands while maintaining accuracy, and enabling practical estimation of "
"observables in chemical and physical systems.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tutorial-tutorial ini fokus pada penganggaran kuantiti yang bermakna secara "
"fizikal, seperti tenaga atau nilai korelasi, dengan menyediakan keadaan "
"kuantum dan mengukur boleh cerapan. Teknik termasuk pendekatan Circuit "
"variasi dan Trotterized yang mengimbangi keupayaan ekspresi Circuit dengan "
"kecekapan kedalaman Circuit. Penekanan diberikan pada aliran kerja yang "
"mengurangkan permintaan sumber kuantum sambil mengekalkan ketepatan, dan "
"membolehkan anggaran praktik bagi boleh cerapan dalam sistem kimia dan "
"fizikal.\n"

