msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"**Error mitigation**\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"**Pengurangan ralat**\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error mitigation addresses the challenge of noise without full fault "
"tolerance by recovering accurate expectation values through controlled "
"circuit manipulation and post-processing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengurangan ralat menangani cabaran hingar tanpa toleransi kesalahan penuh "
"dengan memulihkan nilai jangkaan yang tepat melalui manipulasi Circuit "
"terkawal dan pemprosesan pasca.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
